<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT COMBINED SERVICES 52-6.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT COMBINED SERVICES 52-6.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, England 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat Combined</p>
<p>Services 52-6 in their rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Combined Services - Penalties: Knowles (2)</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Soler, Simes, Bouza, Garcia, Albanesi,</p>
<p>Arbizu, Martin, Promanzio. Conversions: Quesada (6)</p>
</text>
